    "description": "<p><b>Requires:</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">Walking</a>&nbsp;Locomotion System</p><p>Repulsorlift-assisted Jump Servos can be added to any Droid with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">Walking</a> Locomotion System. Jump Servos grant the Droid the ability to treat all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jumps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jumps\">Jumps</a> as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Running_Jumps\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Running Jumps\">Running Jumps</a>, even without a head start (see the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> skill). In addition, the droid may reroll a failed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> check (keeping the better result) and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Take_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Take 10\">Take 10</a> on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a> checks even when rushed or threatened. Jump Servos double the cost of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Walking\" title=\"Walking\">Walking</a> Locomotion System.</p>",
    "cost": "Locomotion System Cost x 2",
    "requires": "Walking Locomotion System"
  },
